WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Could we survive without rulers? Without
the state?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.460
We have survived for centuries despite them and they're destructive wars and stifling oppression.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:20.480
Crippling taxes suck half our wealth away
sprinklings just a fraction back.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:27.200
It has been done before. Archaeology shows some of our ancestors living in peace

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:33.090
for a few thousand years before armed
rulers appear on the scene.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:39.200
Not in caves, but in cities with tens of thousands enjoying civilisation we would recognise.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.460
What would life be like without the
state?

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.500
Less complicated, divisive and confusing for a start.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:52.360
Poverty would be slashed with half our wealth back in circulation

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:56.540
and none wasted on wars and
political schemes.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:02.900
Enterprise and innovation flourish without the regulation that favours large corporations.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:07.160
We do things voluntarily,
never because we are threatened

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:12.420
with damage for non-compliance. It is a
climate in which our cooperative and

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:18.509
charitable nature can flourish. When join
up in a free system we find effective

00:01:18.509 --> 00:01:24.869
ways to meet our community's needs. We
develop systems in which cream rises to

00:01:24.869 --> 00:01:31.420
the top, instead of scum. 
Online vendors value their reputations.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.040
The states only vital function is
protecting us from other versions of itself.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.120
Everything else we could do
ourselves. We could even develop a less

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.220
rigid justice system with no victimless offenses,

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:51.560
that benefits from a reduction in crime and fear.

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:58.760
We could deter, punish and protect with levels of digital exile tailored to the offense.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:02.460
Jails are just so last century.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:07.540
Civilisation developed through the connection and cooperationof people.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:12.320
We are more connected now than at any time in human history.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:17.740
We have the tools to develop structures that self-govern from the bottom up,

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.400
evolving as times change.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:25.360
Could we survive a crash of the global banking system

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:27.300
and the nation states they underwrite?

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:32.000
We could survive and eventually thrive!

